00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:04.410
Platform?

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.826
ANDREW LEE: So it turns out
that Firebase and Google Cloud

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:09.900
Platform are actually
the exact same platform.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.270
Under the hood they
share the same concept

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:16.710
of accounts, of projects, of
billing, so if you go today

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:20.040
and you create a Firebase
project it is, under the hood,

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.210
a cloud project.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.980
And you can go over
to the cloud console

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:24.396
and you can see
the same projects,

00:07:24.396 --> 00:07:26.430
you can manage the same
users, you can set up

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.200
the same information.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.780
Which is really a
very powerful idea

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.330
because Firebase has a nice
set of products to kind of get

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:36.210
going on mobile and
web development,

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:40.290
but cloud has a much more
advanced and larger set

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.880
of tools for the more
advanced applications.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.297
And so this gives
you a nice path.

00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.713
You can start on
the Firebase, you

00:07:45.713 --> 00:07:47.440
can get going with
your application,

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.206
and when you need the more
advanced or powerful features,

00:07:50.206 --> 00:07:52.080
they are all available
from the same platform

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.040
without you needing to set up
a new account or a new project

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.450
or change your billing
profile or anything like that.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.070
Its all right there with Google.

