00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:21.140
to help them build against OS X.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.070
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Nice.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:22.800
JAMES TAMPLIN: So, yeah.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.650
Great to see the
