00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.057
If you want a fork.

00:15:46.057 --> 00:15:47.390
MARK MANDEL: So you can have Go.

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:49.550
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, there's
