00:28:05.640 --> 00:28:08.090
Well listen, so why don't we
get into this week's Question

00:28:08.090 --> 00:28:08.805
of the Week?

00:28:08.805 --> 00:28:10.930
FRANCESC CAMPOY: So yeah,
the Question of the Week,

00:28:10.930 --> 00:28:14.120
it's a pretty simple one but you
know, it's kind of important.

00:28:14.120 --> 00:28:17.550
I actually went through
this not that long ago.

00:28:17.550 --> 00:28:19.820
So imagine that you
have a project running,

00:28:19.820 --> 00:28:22.400
and it's running in production
and there's people using it.

00:28:22.400 --> 00:28:24.470
And at some point you
decide that you don't

00:28:24.470 --> 00:28:26.460
want to handle it anymore.

00:28:26.460 --> 00:28:29.450
So what you want to do is
