00:28:31.010 --> 00:28:32.290
MARK MANDEL: Like a present.

00:28:32.290 --> 00:28:34.802
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah,
it's more like a pet.

00:28:34.802 --> 00:28:36.510
MARK MANDEL: You want
to take care of it?

00:28:36.510 --> 00:28:38.640
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Like oh,
