Identity Access Management.

00:28:46.210 --> 00:28:47.960
But this is actually
like at a high level,

00:28:47.960 --> 00:28:49.680
this isn't really
even at a lower level.

00:28:49.680 --> 00:28:50.900
This is at a project level.

00:28:50.900 --> 00:28:51.680
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:28:51.680 --> 00:28:52.400
MARK MANDEL: So
there's a variety

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:54.733
of roles you can do with the
Identity Access Management,

00:28:54.733 --> 00:28:56.480
or IAM, and one of
them is [INAUDIBLE]..

00:28:56.480 --> 00:28:58.771
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Actually it
was not that long ago when

00:28:58.771 --> 00:29:01.580
we talked about the first
things we ever do with products,

00:29:01.580 --> 00:29:03.580
you mentioned that one
of the things that you do

00:29:03.580 --> 00:29:07.370
is create a like, "add one
more owner" just in case you

00:29:07.370 --> 00:29:09.260
get locked out for
some reason, you

00:29:09.260 --> 00:29:10.690
have another way of accessing.

00:29:10.690 --> 00:29:11.440
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:29:11.440 --> 00:29:13.220
So really here
all you need to do

00:29:13.220 --> 00:29:16.220
is add that extra person that
you're giving the project to.

00:29:16.220 --> 00:29:18.370
Make sure they're an owner,
that's the first step,

00:29:18.370 --> 00:29:20.570
then they can go in and make
the changes they need to make.

00:29:20.570 --> 00:29:22.903
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Wait for
them to accept the invitation.

00:29:22.903 --> 00:29:24.950
MARK MANDEL: Yes, that's
very, very important.

00:29:24.950 --> 00:29:26.560
And the other thing
you'll need to do,

00:29:26.560 --> 00:29:29.210
assuming that the payment
method is going to change,

00:29:29.210 --> 00:29:31.610
is have them go into
the billing section

00:29:31.610 --> 00:29:33.720
and make it switch over
to the payment section

00:29:33.720 --> 00:29:35.070
that they're happy with.

00:29:35.070 --> 00:29:35.945
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yep.

00:29:35.945 --> 00:29:38.600
And then they should remove
you as an owner, and that's it.

00:29:38.600 --> 00:29:40.400
MARK MANDEL: Yeah, I mean,
they could remove you entirely,

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:42.590
maybe they drop you to an
editor, or a viewer level,

00:29:42.590 --> 00:29:45.090
it really depends on exactly how
things are going to go forward.

00:29:45.090 --> 00:29:45.980
FRANCESC CAMPOY: But
yeah, it's very simple.

00:29:45.980 --> 00:29:48.890
You just need to be careful
making sure that everything

00:29:48.890 --> 00:29:50.270
goes on the good steps.

00:29:50.270 --> 00:29:52.490
Otherwise you could lock
yourself out and you know,

00:29:52.490 --> 00:29:54.229
